                           default its value is _/_t_m_p_/_k_t_r_._o_u_t.  If the file
                           name is changed while kkttrr is enabled it will not
                           take effect until the next invocation.

     _d_e_b_u_g_._k_t_r_._a_l_q___e_n_a_b_l_e  enables logging of kkttrr entries to disk if it is set
                           to one.  Setting this to 0 will terminate logging
